    "description": "What a screen reader announces for one candidate chip: the numeral and which numbering system it is written in. Both are Strings -- an int placeholder would send ckb through intl's missing symbol data and silently emit Latin digits, and would also re-format a numeral the round deliberately pinned to the other script.",
    "x-review": "native-speaker-pending"
  },
