  },
  "lightFieldTimeLabel": "میانگین میدان",
  "@lightFieldTimeLabel": {
    "description": "The middle cell of False Light's results trio. A sweep is not a reflex, so an average per TAP would measure nothing a player recognises; the number they feel is how long a whole field took to clear.",
